  "method": [
    "The original default and serial controls use the same extracted PR #35 preview executable and pinned GGUFs.",
    "All four Qwen model rows use the worker canonical HIP reference at the policy commit, batch 512, micro-batch 1, single-slot F32 KV and flash attention disabled.",
