    "OpenCode 1.19.4 runs directly against the extracted package with bounded tools, a fresh server per fixture and independent frozen acceptance tests. No synthetic responses, supervisor edits or tool repairs.",
    "Every GPU/model run is remote. Owned process groups and task-owned clients are stopped after each command."
